>getting killed and without being chased by the Keystone Kops? I am
>talking only about the upper levels.

There are many ways to kill a shopkeeper. My preffered way :-) is getting
invisible in the shop and zapping a wand of fire/magic missile/cold ( anything
producing a ray, except wand of sleep :-), will do ) on the shopkeeper.
Since you are invisible the shopkepper will not leave the shopentrance, so
you may kill him from a distance.

Another way is to polymorph the shopkeeper into anything harmless ( grid bug,
newt or small mimic etc.... ) and kill him.

I don't think that the Keystone Kops will hunt you if you only (?) kill a
shopkeeper, they will only appear when you escape from the shop without
paying.

